  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Thickheadedness\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Thickheadedness.png\" title=\"Image:Thickheadedness.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Thickheadedness.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Thickheadedness.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Self Buff\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Increases Stun Resistance\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Thickheadedness decreases your susceptability to stuns and knock-downs.<br/>\nThis skill is could be a lifesaver as, a player can not use any skills while knocked down.\nOf course, a player cannot deal damage of any sort when on their back like an over-turned turtle.\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Cool Down:</b> varies\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Increases your Stun Resistance by X % for 45 seconds.</b><br/>\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 7\n</td><td> 17\n</td><td> 27\n</td><td> 37\n</td><td> 47\n</td><td> 57\n</td><td> 67\n</td><td> 77\n</td><td> 87\n</td><td> 97\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">X\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 65\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 80\n</td><td> 85\n</td><td> 90\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Mana\n</td><td> 34.3\n</td><td> 56.8\n</td><td> 79.3\n</td><td> 101.8\n</td><td> 124.3\n</td><td> 146.7\n</td><td> 169.2\n</td><td> 197.7\n</td><td> 214.2\n</td><td> 236.7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Cool Down<br/>(Seconds)\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 87\n</td><td> 84\n</td><td> 81\n</td><td> 78\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 72\n</td><td> 69\n</td><td> 66\n</td><td> 60\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"5%\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 7795\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
